WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
A screen recording of the service. Only the wait for the translation is sped up.

00:03.500 --> 00:06.000
We pick a file and a language

00:06.000 --> 00:07.500
We press “Translate” (Перевести) — the only button

00:07.500 --> 00:12.000
The rest is on us: the project is created and the translation starts by itself 7 seconds later

00:12.000 --> 00:27.200
Translation and checks run on their own · shown ×12 · really 2 min 15 s

00:27.200 --> 00:31.500
Done: all 4 lines translated and checked — 2 min 21 s after the click

00:31.500 --> 00:41.100
“Download” (Скачать) — the same Word file, now in English

